[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ライブにドラマにバラエティー……\r\nめぐるもすっかりいろんな場所に引っ張りだこだな",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040030010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00011",
    "bgm": "005"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004110010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ！\r\nいろんなお仕事ができて、すっごく楽しいよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300411/2003004110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（仕事続きでも元気だな……\r\nさすがはめぐるだ）",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "打ち合わせ前に、ちょっと休憩するか",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004110020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えっ！　じゃあじゃあ、ちょっとプロデューサーに\r\n聞いてほしいことがあるんだー！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300411/2003004110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、なんだ？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004110030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あのねっ！　プロデューサーも見に来てくれた、\r\nバレーの試合のときのことなんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300411/2003004110030"
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
      "height": 640,
      "color": "000000"
    },
    "effectValue": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": 1000,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 1000
    }
  },
  {
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "effectLabel": "black",
